# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI Reality Town environment example.
#
# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and fill in REAL values only locally.
# NEVER commit real values. `.env`, `.env.local`, and `.env.*.local` are gitignored.
#
# Phase 0 status: the deterministic Fake Simulation Provider needs NONE of the LLM
# variables below. The offline checks (typecheck, lint, test, build) require no `.env`
# at all. These entries are placeholders for future, post-Phase-0 work.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Convex (only needed to RUN the live simulation, not to build/test) ---
# CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT=your-deployment-name
# VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://your-deployment.convex.cloud

# --- LLM provider (NOT USED in Phase 0; the fake provider proposes events instead) ---
# When a real provider is introduced, these configure it. Upstream AI Town's adapter
# (`convex/util/llm.ts`) reads equivalent variables (e.g. OPENAI_API_KEY, LLM_API_URL).
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://your-llm-endpoint.example.com
# LLM_API_KEY=replace-me-with-a-real-key-only-locally
# LLM_MODEL=replace-me
# EMBEDDING_MODEL=replace-me

# --- Observability (NOT USED in Phase 0) ---
# LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY=
# LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=
# LANGFUSE_BASE_URL=https://cloud.langfuse.com
